Sorry, to clarify my previous reply

" For the benefit of others who find this, I can confirm that the lightpeak variable in M$metalong (Part 1 output) is (almost) identical to the lightpeak variable in the ms5.outraw RData files (Part 5 output)."

They are almost identical because ms5.outraw lightpeak is the rounded form of M$metalong lightpeak, i.e. lightpeak.ms5.outraw equals round(lightpeak.metalong)

